  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "**Too** can mean *more than enough* (*too hot*) or *also* (*me too*); many languages use two different words.",
    "grammar": "**Too** before an adjective usually means *more than is good*: *too expensive to buy*. To say only that something is very good, use **very**, not **too**: *The food was very good*.",
